@startuml platform_comparison
title Ray vs Modal vs Fly.io - Platform Comparison

' ==================== STYLE ====================
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam noteFontSize 13
skinparam packageFontSize 15
skinparam componentFontSize 13
skinparam padding 5
skinparam packagePadding 10

left to right direction

' ==================== COMPARISON TABLE ====================
note as compTable #Wheat
  **Feature Comparison**
  | Feature | Ray | Modal | Fly.io |
  |---------|-----|-------|--------|
  | Primary Use | Distributed ML | Serverless AI | Edge/GPU |
  | Isolation | Process | gVisor | Firecracker |
  | GPU | Excellent | Strong | A10/L40S/A100 |
  | Autoscale | V2 + Kueue | Yes | Scale-to-zero |
  | Cold Start | N/A | <1s | <1s |
  | Scaling | 1000s GPUs | 10K+ sandboxes | Global edge |
  | Best For | ML Training | Code Sandbox | GPU Inference |
end note

' ==================== RAY ====================
package "Ray" as ray #LightBlue {
  component "ML Training\n(OpenAI)" as r1
  component "RL Agents" as r2
  component "Object Store\n(Zero-copy)" as r3
  component "Gang Scheduling\n(Kueue)" as r4 #PaleGreen
}

note bottom of ray #LightCyan
  **Strengths**: Sub-ms scheduling,
  Multi-GPU, Stateful actors
  **Weaknesses**: Complex setup
end note

' ==================== MODAL ====================
package "Modal" as modal #LightGreen {
  component "Code Sandbox\n(gVisor)" as m1
  component "Serverless\nGPU" as m2
  component "Volumes\n(Data)" as m3
}

note bottom of modal #Honeydew
  **Strengths**: Zero config,
  <1s cold start, Python SDK
  **Weaknesses**: No on-prem
end note

' ==================== FLY.IO ====================
package "Fly.io" as flyio #LightCoral {
  component "Micro-VMs\n(Firecracker)" as f1
  component "GPU\n(A10/A100)" as f2
  component "Global\nEdge" as f3
}

note bottom of flyio #MistyRose
  **Strengths**: <1s spin-up,
  Scale-to-zero, Per-second
  **Weaknesses**: Limited regions
end note

' ==================== DECISION ====================
note as decision #Lavender
  **When to Use**
  **Ray**: Multi-GPU training, RL agents
  **Modal**: Untrusted code, serverless
  **Fly.io**: Edge GPU, scale-to-zero
end note

' ==================== LAYOUT ====================
compTable -[hidden]right-> ray
ray -[hidden]right-> modal
modal -[hidden]right-> flyio
compTable -[hidden]down-> decision

@enduml
